      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Traditional single-phase ZrB2 is vulnerable to corrosion by liquid plating metals.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is addition of a Si-based dopant followed by spark plasma sintering at 1600–1700 °C under inert gas.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Si-based dopant reduces the sintering activation energy of ZrB2.",
